
1. CSV parser edge cases
  ok  - quoted field with embedded comma
  ok  - escaped quote inside a quoted field
  ok  - leading zeros are preserved as-is (never numeric-normalized)
  ok  - internal spaces and hyphens survive untouched
  ok  - CRLF line endings parse the same as LF
  ok  - blank lines are skipped, not treated as rows
  ok  - header names are trimmed

2. Legacy CSV generator: determinism (fixtures only)
